            "title": "盤中速報 - 雷笛克光學(5230)股價拉至漲停，漲停價28.9元，成交1,691張",
            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>雷笛克光學(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:5230:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/5230\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">5230-TW</a>)23日09:30上漲2.6元，股價漲停報28.9元，委買1,190,000張，成交1,691張。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>主要業務為照明設備製造業。光學儀器製造業。電子零組件製造業。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>雷笛克光學(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:5230:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/5230\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">5230-TW</a>)近5日股價下跌25.28%，櫃買市場<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/TWS/TSE01\">加權指數</a>下跌23.1%，短期股價無明顯表現。</p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>近5日籌碼</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul> <li>三大法人合計買賣超：+561 張</li> <li>外資買賣超：+579 張</li> <li>投信買賣超：0 張</li> <li>自營商買賣超：-18 張</li> <li>融資增減：-596 張</li> <li>融券增減：-83 張</li> </ul></section></main>",
